            <ArticleTitle>Risk of statin therapy in elderly.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>555-556</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A meta-analysis of younger patients included in randomized trials found good evidence that statins reduce vascular events and mortality in people with high cholesterol and the risk of coronary heart disease. The use pf statin in the elderly prevents the disease but can exert considerable side effects.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
